%description:
Tests that tsRecentAfterAckCheck also keeps TS.Recent from a segment that
rfc5961AckCheck drops, as Linux tcp_ack() returns before
tcp_replace_ts_recent(). The scenario is that of tcp_rfc5961_ack_1 with
timestamps: the tester subtracts 20000 from the ACK field of a data segment of
the server, and the client drops it. The ACK of the client in reply echoes the
TSval of the segment before, not the TSval of the dropped one.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1012 # 1000 bytes of data with the TS option
*.cli_tcp.rfc5961AckCheck = true
*.cli_tcp.tsRecentAfterAckCheck = true
*.*_tcp.timestampSupport = true
*.srv_app.tSend = 2s
*.srv_app.sendBytes = 100B
*.tcptester.script="B3 ackadd 4294947296"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[2.001 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A 501:601(100) ack 4294948297 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(2000,1000)# changing the ACK field
[2.003 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(2002,1202)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
ACK below SND.UNA - MAX.SND.WND (RFC 5961 section 5.2): dropping the segment and sending an ACK
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
